刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-883c0927aa968cdb0ae9","start":7,"end":161,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-f0c499a590b00f986d21","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-2c211642b5918230ce4c","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖以客礼待之，使为豫州牧。嘉言于太祖曰：‘备有雄才，而甚得众心。张飞、关羽者，皆万人之敌也，为之死用。嘉观之，备终不为人下，其谋未可测也。古人有言：“一日纵敌，数世之患。”宜早为之所。’是时，太祖奉天子以号令天下，方招怀英雄以明大信，未得从嘉谋","attribution":"裴注·《傅子》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-883c0927aa968cdb0ae9","start":178,"end":301,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
